Daniel,

We found the issue. The underlying function ‘tps’ was generating the grid spacing based on the target landmark range instead of the reference (this was old code originally from the ‘Morpohmetrics in R’ book). We have fixed that and things seem to be resolved.

Please download a new version from the stable branch on github

devtools::install_github("geomorphR/geomorph", ref = "Stable")

Dean

